%% Status: CURRENT — implemented
sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser as StudyChat
  participant TS as TanStack /api/chat
  participant SB as Supabase
  participant Adapter as server-only adapter
  participant API as FastAPI /api/chat
  participant Ctx as Context/RAG
  participant Model as Local Qwen
  Browser->>TS: bearer token + UI messages + selected model + uiLanguage
  TS->>SB: verify claims and read owned thread
  SB-->>TS: verified subject and thread
  TS->>TS: require explicit safety allow
  TS->>SB: idempotently upsert user message
  TS->>Adapter: token, IDs, model, subject, UI/effective language
  Adapter->>API: Authorization and matching X-Student-Id
  API->>SB: independently verify token, thread, and prior stable response
  API->>API: repeat safety gate and probe selected local model
  API->>Ctx: compile caller-owned context
  Ctx->>SB: publishable key, caller JWT, and RLS
  API->>Model: bounded prompt
  Model-->>API: answer
  API->>SB: upsert stable assistant ID + exact response metadata
  API-->>TS: answer, sources, model, language, request ID
  TS-->>Browser: AI-SDK UI-message stream
  TS->>SB: upsert same assistant ID with final UI parts
  Note over API,SB: Same ID/body retry replays exact persisted response, changed body returns 409
